# json: format nested structures
[include %libdir "cli/out/json.llt"]
---
[call %.json [
  users: [
    [name: "Alice" active: true]
    [name: "Bob" active: false]
  ]
  count: 2
]]
=== out
String("{\"users\":[{\"name\":\"Alice\",\"active\":true},{\"name\":\"Bob\",\"active\":false}],\"count\":2}")
